sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant P as PC Serial Terminal
    participant M as STM32 Nucleo
    participant R as FreeRTOS Scheduler
    participant T as Telemetry Task

    U->>P: Open COM port at 115200
    M->>R: Start scheduler
    loop every tick / delay period
        R->>T: Schedule telemetry task
        T->>T: Generate random telemetry
        T->>P: UART transmit data
        P->>U: Display live output
    end
